  "1-6-mass-moles-particles": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 160\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"t\">\n  <title id=\"t\">Three boxes in a row. Left: mass, m, in grams. Middle: amount, n, in moles. Right: number of particles, N. An arrow from mass to amount is labelled divide by M; an arrow back from amount to mass is labelled multiply by M. An arrow from amount to particles is labelled multiply by N A; an arrow back from particles to amount is labelled divide by N A.</title>\n  <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\">\n    <rect x=\"10\" y=\"45\" width=\"120\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\"/>\n    <rect x=\"210\" y=\"45\" width=\"120\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"var(--t1-ink)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/>\n    <rect x=\"410\" y=\"45\" width=\"120\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-family=\"inherit\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <text x=\"70\" y=\"76\">mass, <tspan font-style=\"italic\">m</tspan></text>\n    <text x=\"70\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">in g</text>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"76\" fill=\"var(--t1-ink)\">amount, <tspan font-style=\"italic\">n</tspan></text>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">in mol</text>\n    <text x=\"470\" y=\"76\">particles, <tspan font-style=\"italic\">N</tspan></text>\n    <text x=\"470\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">a count</text>\n  </g>\n  <!-- forward arrows (top) -->\n  <path d=\"M134 65 L198 65\" stroke=\"var(--t2-ink)\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" fill=\"none\"/>\n  <polygon points=\"206,65 197,60.5 197,69.5\" fill=\"var(--t2-ink)\"/>\n  <path d=\"M334 65 L398 65\" stroke=\"var(--t3-ink)\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" fill=\"none\"/>\n  <polygon points=\"406,65 397,60.5 397,69.5\" fill=\"var(--t3-ink)\"/>\n  <!-- backward arrows (bottom) -->\n  <path d=\"M206 95 L142 95\" stroke=\"var(--t2-ink)\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" fill=\"none\"/>\n  <polygon points=\"134,95 143,90.5 143,99.5\" fill=\"var(--t2-ink)\"/>\n  <path d=\"M406 95 L342 95\" stroke=\"var(--t3-ink)\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" fill=\"none\"/>\n  <polygon points=\"334,95 343,90.5 343,99.5\" fill=\"var(--t3-ink)\"/>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"inherit\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <text x=\"170\" y=\"35\" fill=\"var(--t2-ink)\">÷ <tspan font-style=\"italic\">M</tspan></text>\n    <text x=\"170\" y=\"135\" fill=\"var(--t2-ink)\">× <tspan font-style=\"italic\">M</tspan></text>\n    <text x=\"370\" y=\"35\" fill=\"var(--t3-ink)\">× <tspan font-style=\"italic\">N</tspan><tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"10\">A</tspan></text>\n    <text x=\"370\" y=\"135\" fill=\"var(--t3-ink)\">÷ <tspan font-style=\"italic\">N</tspan><tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"10\">A</tspan></text>\n  </g>\n</svg>",
  "1-7-formula-route": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 440 400\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"t\">\n  <title id=\"t\">Flow chart from data to formulas, five boxes in a column joined by downward arrows. Box 1: mass of each element in grams; for percentages, take a 100 gram sample. Arrow labelled divide by Ar. Box 2: amount of each element in moles. Arrow labelled divide by the smallest amount. Box 3: mole ratio. Arrow labelled round, or multiply by 2, 3 or 4, to whole numbers. Box 4: empirical formula. Arrow labelled multiply by n, where n is the molar mass divided by the molar mass of the empirical formula. Box 5: molecular formula.</title>\n  <g fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.6\">\n    <rect x=\"20\" y=\"14\" width=\"200\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"var(--t1-ink)\"/>\n    <rect x=\"20\" y=\"96\" width=\"200\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"var(--t1-ink)\"/>\n    <rect x=\"20\" y=\"178\" width=\"200\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"var(--t1-ink)\"/>\n    <rect x=\"20\" y=\"260\" width=\"200\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"var(--t2-ink)\"/>\n    <rect x=\"20\" y=\"342\" width=\"200\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"var(--t3-ink)\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-family=\"inherit\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <text x=\"120\" y=\"41\">mass of each element (g)</text>\n    <text x=\"120\" y=\"123\">amount of each element (mol)</text>\n    <text x=\"120\" y=\"205\">mole ratio</text>\n    <text x=\"120\" y=\"287\" fill=\"var(--t2-ink)\">empirical formula</text>\n    <text x=\"120\" y=\"369\" fill=\"var(--t3-ink)\">molecular formula</text>\n  </g>\n  <g stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"none\">\n    <path d=\"M120 58 L120 88\"/>\n    <path d=\"M120 140 L120 170\"/>\n    <path d=\"M120 222 L120 252\"/>\n    <path d=\"M120 304 L120 334\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g fill=\"currentColor\">\n    <polygon points=\"120,95 115.5,86 124.5,86\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"120,177 115.5,168 124.5,168\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"120,259 115.5,250 124.5,250\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"120,341 115.5,332 124.5,332\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" font-family=\"inherit\">\n    <text x=\"232\" y=\"32\">percentages: take a</text>\n    <text x=\"232\" y=\"47\">100 g sample</text>\n    <text x=\"134\" y=\"80\">÷ A<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"9\">r</tspan> of the element</text>\n    <text x=\"134\" y=\"162\">÷ the smallest amount</text>\n    <text x=\"134\" y=\"238\">round, or × 2, 3 or 4,</text>\n    <text x=\"134\" y=\"252\">to whole numbers</text>\n    <text x=\"134\" y=\"320\">× n, where n = M ÷ M(empirical formula)</text>\n  </g>\n</svg>",
  "1-8-calibration-curve": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 470 300\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"t\">\n  <title id=\"t\">Calibration curve. Absorbance on the vertical axis, from 0 to 0.400, against concentration in moles per cubic decimetre on the horizontal axis, from 0 to 0.0500. Five standard solutions, 0.0100 to 0.0500, are plotted as points that lie on a straight line through the origin; the 0.0500 standard has absorbance 0.360. A dashed line runs across from an absorbance of 0.270 to the line, then down to the concentration axis at 0.0375.</title>\n  <path d=\"M60 250 H440\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n  <path d=\"M60 250 V40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n  <g stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\">\n    <path d=\"M132 250 v5\"/>\n    <path d=\"M204 250 v5\"/>\n    <path d=\"M276 250 v5\"/>\n    <path d=\"M348 250 v5\"/>\n    <path d=\"M420 250 v5\"/>\n    <path d=\"M60 200 h-5\"/>\n    <path d=\"M60 150 h-5\"/>\n    <path d=\"M60 100 h-5\"/>\n    <path d=\"M60 50 h-5\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g font-size=\"11\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-family=\"inherit\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <text x=\"60\" y=\"268\">0</text>\n    <text x=\"132\" y=\"268\">0.0100</text>\n    <text x=\"204\" y=\"268\">0.0200</text>\n    <text x=\"276\" y=\"268\">0.0300</text>\n    <text x=\"348\" y=\"268\">0.0400</text>\n    <text x=\"420\" y=\"268\">0.0500</text>\n  </g>\n  <g font-size=\"11\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-family=\"inherit\" text-anchor=\"end\">\n    <text x=\"51\" y=\"204\">0.100</text>\n    <text x=\"51\" y=\"154\">0.200</text>\n    <text x=\"51\" y=\"104\">0.300</text>\n    <text x=\"51\" y=\"54\">0.400</text>\n  </g>\n  <text x=\"250\" y=\"292\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-family=\"inherit\" text-anchor=\"middle\">concentration / mol dm⁻³</text>\n  <text x=\"16\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-family=\"inherit\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 16 150)\">absorbance</text>\n  <path d=\"M60 250 L436 62\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--t1-ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <g fill=\"var(--t1-ink)\">\n    <circle cx=\"132\" cy=\"214\" r=\"4\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"204\" cy=\"178\" r=\"4\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"276\" cy=\"142\" r=\"4\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"348\" cy=\"106\" r=\"4\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"420\" cy=\"70\" r=\"4\"/>\n  </g>\n  <path d=\"M60 115 H330 V250\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--t2-ink)\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/>\n  <g font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"inherit\" fill=\"var(--t2-ink)\">\n    <text x=\"66\" y=\"108\">unknown: 0.270</text>\n    <text x=\"336\" y=\"240\">0.0375</text>\n  </g>\n</svg>",
