  "5-7-k-and-arrhenius-plot": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 280\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"t57kp\">\n  <title id=\"t57kp\">Two graphs side by side. Left: rate constant k against temperature T in kelvin; a curve starts low and rises more and more steeply. Right: the Arrhenius plot, ln k against 1 over T; a straight line slopes downwards from top left to bottom right. A right-angled triangle under the line marks its gradient, labelled gradient equals minus Ea over R. The line is extended as a dashed line up to the vertical axis at 1 over T equals zero, where the intercept is labelled ln A.</title>\n  <defs>\n    <marker id=\"m57kp-head\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n      <path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n    </marker>\n  </defs>\n\n  <!-- Left panel: k against T -->\n  <g>\n    <g stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" fill=\"none\">\n      <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"28\" marker-end=\"url(#m57kp-head)\"/>\n      <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"230\" marker-end=\"url(#m57kp-head)\"/>\n    </g>\n    <path d=\"M62,222 C140,218 200,200 236,150 C256,120 268,85 276,48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--t1-ink)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n    <g font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-family=\"inherit\">\n      <text x=\"160\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\">k rises more and more steeply</text>\n      <text x=\"36\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">k</text>\n      <text x=\"282\" y=\"252\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan font-style=\"italic\">T</tspan> / K</text>\n    </g>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- Right panel: ln k against 1/T -->\n  <g transform=\"translate(330,0)\">\n    <g stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" fill=\"none\">\n      <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"28\" marker-end=\"url(#m57kp-head)\"/>\n      <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"230\" marker-end=\"url(#m57kp-head)\"/>\n    </g>\n    <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"97\" stroke=\"var(--t1-ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 5\"/>\n    <line x1=\"140\" y1=\"97\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"var(--t1-ink)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n    <g fill=\"var(--t1-ink)\">\n      <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"102\" r=\"3.5\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"185\" cy=\"119.5\" r=\"3.5\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"137\" r=\"3.5\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"255\" cy=\"154.5\" r=\"3.5\"/>\n    </g>\n    <g stroke=\"var(--t5-ink)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\">\n      <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"107\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"157\"/>\n      <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"157\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"157\"/>\n    </g>\n    <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"52\" r=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--t3-ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <g font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-family=\"inherit\">\n      <text x=\"160\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\">Arrhenius plot: a straight line</text>\n      <text x=\"36\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ln <tspan font-style=\"italic\">k</tspan></text>\n      <text x=\"270\" y=\"252\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1/<tspan font-style=\"italic\">T</tspan> / K<tspan font-size=\"9\" dy=\"-5\">−1</tspan></text>\n      <text x=\"44\" y=\"246\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">0</text>\n      <text x=\"60\" y=\"44\" fill=\"var(--t3-ink)\">intercept = ln <tspan font-style=\"italic\">A</tspan></text>\n      <text x=\"168\" y=\"195\" fill=\"var(--t5-ink)\">gradient = −<tspan font-style=\"italic\">E</tspan><tspan font-size=\"9\" dy=\"3\">a</tspan><tspan dy=\"-3\">/</tspan><tspan font-style=\"italic\">R</tspan></text>\n    </g>\n  </g>\n</svg>",
  "5-7-two-lines": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 270\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"t57tl\">\n  <title id=\"t57tl\">Arrhenius plot, ln k against 1 over T, with two straight lines that both slope downwards over the same range of 1 over T and cross near the middle. The line for reaction P is steeper than the line for reaction Q. P is labelled steeper, larger activation energy, and Q is labelled shallower, smaller activation energy.</title>\n  <defs>\n    <marker id=\"m57tl-head\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n      <path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n    </marker>\n  </defs>\n  <g stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" fill=\"none\">\n    <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"20\" marker-end=\"url(#m57tl-head)\"/>\n    <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"230\" marker-end=\"url(#m57tl-head)\"/>\n  </g>\n  <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"var(--t1-ink)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"var(--t4-ink)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <g font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"inherit\">\n    <text x=\"36\" y=\"34\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">ln <tspan font-style=\"italic\">k</tspan></text>\n    <text x=\"340\" y=\"252\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">1/<tspan font-style=\"italic\">T</tspan> / K<tspan font-size=\"9\" dy=\"-5\">−1</tspan></text>\n    <text x=\"160\" y=\"182\" fill=\"var(--t1-ink)\">P: steeper,</text>\n    <text x=\"160\" y=\"198\" fill=\"var(--t1-ink)\">larger <tspan font-style=\"italic\">E</tspan><tspan font-size=\"9\" dy=\"3\">a</tspan></text>\n    <text x=\"200\" y=\"66\" fill=\"var(--t4-ink)\">Q: shallower,</text>\n    <text x=\"200\" y=\"82\" fill=\"var(--t4-ink)\">smaller <tspan font-style=\"italic\">E</tspan><tspan font-size=\"9\" dy=\"3\">a</tspan></text>\n  </g>\n</svg>",
